    "detailed_description": "<h1>\ud83d\udc95ONANI\u307e\u3057\u3087\u3046\ud83d\udc49\ud83d\udc4c</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2136820/extras/605111d9db17a570db40d31b2a8bb2f6.poster.avif?t=1738739052\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2136820/extras/605111d9db17a570db40d31b2a8bb2f6.webm?t=1738739052\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2136820/extras/605111d9db17a570db40d31b2a8bb2f6.mp4?t=1738739052\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2136820/extras/63c593c1cddb84165dcca04684de08bd.avif?t=1738739052\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Story:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Free City, a famous red-light district full of brothels with a variety of races attracts both locals and foreigners. Suddenly, due to the opening of a competing brothel that provides new and innovative sexual services, the old brothels find themselves nearly out of business. The new brothel is run by reincarnators and the red-light district must find a way to survive its competition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Game info:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The goal of the game is to unify all the brothels and manage a better business than the competing reincarnator's brothel with cheat-like otherworld knowledge. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are two difficulties:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Casual mode: There is no ongoing debt. You can outshine the competition eventually in a debt-free situation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Normal mode: There is a monthly debt to be paid. The brothels are in danger of closing if the reincarnator's brothel continues to attract your customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are three major elements to the game:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-H Battle:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">To gain the trust of various races, you must satisfy the head prostitute in each race's brothel. You can sign a cooperative contract after gaining the trust of the head prostitute. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-Research:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can learn various otherworldly sexual services in the reincarnator's brothel. After learning from the competition, you can further enhance sexual services by taking advantage of your racial traits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-Open for business:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The true essence of a brothel. Face your competition, learn the skills, and upgrade your techniques!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-Controls:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">General\uff1a(Mouse)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\uff0eLeft button\uff1aDecide</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\uff0eRight button\uff1a Cancel</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-H Battle</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\uff0eHold the left button: Begin gameplay actions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\uff0eHold the right button: Speed up action</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-50+ base HCG, 150+ CG</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2136820/extras/63c593c1cddb84165dcca04684de08bd.avif?t=1738739052\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Story:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Free City, a famous red-light district full of brothels with a variety of races attracts both locals and foreigners. Suddenly, due to the opening of a competing brothel that provides new and innovative sexual services, the old brothels find themselves nearly out of business. The new brothel is run by reincarnators and the red-light district must find a way to survive its competition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Game info:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The goal of the game is to unify all the brothels and manage a better business than the competing reincarnator's brothel with cheat-like otherworld knowledge. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are two difficulties:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Casual mode: There is no ongoing debt. You can outshine the competition eventually in a debt-free situation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Normal mode: There is a monthly debt to be paid. The brothels are in danger of closing if the reincarnator's brothel continues to attract your customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are three major elements to the game:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-H Battle:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">To gain the trust of various races, you must satisfy the head prostitute in each race's brothel. You can sign a cooperative contract after gaining the trust of the head prostitute. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-Research:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can learn various otherworldly sexual services in the reincarnator's brothel. After learning from the competition, you can further enhance sexual services by taking advantage